# The official Python slim base image currently carries vulnerable bootstrap
# setuptools/msgpack metadata in lower image layers. The Dockerfile removes these
# packages from the final runtime filesystem and verifies their absence. Trivy's
# layer/package scanner can still report the lower-layer package records, so only
# these build-only/base-layer advisories are suppressed here.
